## Debug Logging Mandate (Code Insertion)
**See**: [Debug Logging Mandate](shared/debug-logging-mandate.md)

The `debug-level` parameter controls debug logging code **inserted INTO source files**.

**Quick Reference**:
- `none` (default): Production-ready code, no debug logging
- `simple`: Basic debug markers for validation
- `trace`: Comprehensive debug markers with state tracking
- `cleanup`: Remove all debug markers matching `[DEBUG-WORKITEM:*] ;CLEANUP_OK`

---

## Warning Handling Mandate
**See**: [Warning Handling Mandate](shared/warning-handling-mandate.md)

**CRITICAL**: Warnings = BLOCKING ERRORS — ZERO errors, ZERO warnings policy enforced.

**Key Points**:
- Run build validation after EVERY change
- Auto-retry fixing warnings (3 attempts max)
- Immediate stop and escalation if warnings persist
- Rollback trigger on persistent warnings

