Task is considered successful when:

✅ All phases implemented
✅ Build succeeds (0 errors, 0 warnings)
✅ All analyzers pass
✅ All linters pass
✅ All tests pass
✅ Contracts validated (if applicable)
✅ Integration tests pass (if applicable)
✅ Documentation updated
✅ Changes committed

